// Cyrus launch check collector + CLI. READ ONLY: curl GET/HEAD (plus one empty POST to the error-log and webhook
// endpoints, which both refuse it), psql in a read-only transaction, nginx -t, openssl s_client, file reads.
// Prints no secret values (env values are only used for presence/mode). Evaluation lives in launch-eval.mjs.
//   node scripts/cyrus/lib/launch-check.mjs [beta|public] [--json FILE] [--facts]
// Env overrides (all optional): ENVF, SVC, CYRUS_PUBLIC_URL, CYRUS_NXEON_URL, CYRUS_ADMIN_HOST, CYRUS_NGINX_CONF,
