// Cyrus plans + top-ups on Stripe. Server only; plain module (webhook, routes, worker).
//
// Plans are real Stripe Billing subscriptions (monthly). Every PAID plan invoice grants
// that month's tokens, keyed by the invoice id (`plan:<invoiceId>`), so tokens stack on
// each renewal and a webhook redelivery, the return redirect and the reconcile sweep can
// all run the same grant without double-granting. Top-ups are one-off Checkout payments
// keyed by the session id (`topup:<sessionId>`).
//
// ISOLATION FROM THE WALLET: our Checkout Sessions carry `cyrusUserId`, NEVER
// `nxeonUserId`. lib/fulfil-checkout.ts classifies a session without `nxeonUserId` as
// "unpaid" and does nothing, so the platform's wallet/order fulfilment can never mistake
// a Cyrus purchase for a wallet top-up (test/cyrus-tokens-stripe.test.ts pins this).
