//   node scripts/cyrus/beta-report.mjs [--hours 24] [--json FILE] [--discord]
//   node scripts/cyrus/beta-report.mjs --hours 168        # the week
// Needs DATABASE_URL (read from /opt/nxeon/.env like launch-check, or CYRUS_DATABASE_URL). Tables that do not exist yet
